Alex and Jun each invest \$1800 for 5 years.

\begin{itemize}
\item Alex's investment earns simple interest at a rate of $7.5\%$ per annum.
\item Jun's investment earns interest at a rate of $6.0\%$ per annum, compounding quarterly.
\end{itemize}

By calculating the interest earned over the 5 years, determine who will have the greater amount.
